### Register (expected future endpoint)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "student2@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123!",
  "firstName": "Maria",
  "lastName": "Santos"
}

###

### Login (expected future endpoint)
# Optional token capture snippet for REST Client:
# > {%
# client.global.set("jwt", response.body.token);
# %}
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "student2@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123!"
}

###

### Example authorized request (expected future protected route)
GET {{host}}/api/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Accept: application/json
